# blender
# Raw .blend authoring sources live on the asset bucket (Drive), not in
# git — synced via `pnpm assets:pull` / `assets:push`, auto-backed-up by
# the pre-push hook. See docs/asset-storage.md. (tracks-src/README.md +
# blender_assets.cats.txt stay tracked.)
tracks-src/*.blend
bikes-src/*.blend
tracks-src/*.blend1
bikes-src/*.blend1
tracks-src/*.blend@
bikes-src/*.blend@
tools/blender/lib/*.blend1
tools/blender/lib/*.blend@

# python bytecode (Blender headless scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Electron desktop build output (Steam Deck / Windows wrappers)
dist-electron/
